      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Я</span><rt>Ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dúmayu\" data-defn=\"думаю\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">ду́маю</span><rt>dúmayu</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chto\" data-defn=\"что\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">что</span><rt>chto</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"byt&#x27;\" data-defn=\"быть\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">быть</span><rt>byt&#x27;</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nastávnikom\" data-defn=\"наставником\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">наста́вником</span><rt>nastávnikom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"slíshkom\" data-defn=\"слишком\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">сли́шком</span><rt>slíshkom</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"trudńo\" data-defn=\"трудно\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">трудн́о</span><rt>trudńo</rt></ruby>.",
